-- =====================================================================
-- RRNetBanking — Slice 3: a third demo customer
--
-- Needed to demonstrate the legacy cross-customer delete is gone. That
-- bug was
--
--   delete from bene where tacc = <request parameter>
--
-- with no owner clause, so it removed that payee for EVERY customer who
-- had registered it. Reproducing it takes two customers who have both
-- registered the SAME target account — with only rahul and priya, each
-- can only register the other, and the targets differ.
--
-- meera is that third account. rahul and priya can both register her, and
-- rahul removing his payee must leave priya's untouched.
--
-- The Slice 1 after-startup microflow gives her an account, and the Slice
-- 2 one gives that account a ledger, with no changes needed here.
-- =====================================================================

CREATE DEMO USER 'meera' PASSWORD 'RRCustomer2026!' ENTITY Banking.Customer (Customer);
/
